  "name": "normalised EMG RMS",
  "definition": "EMG RMS (250-ms centred window, 30-450 Hz, 130 ms electromechanical delay) at 10/20/30/40/50% of the direction-specific MVC, normalised to MVE = the muscle's peak RMS over all MVC trials in the six directions; group means (no SD plotted); session 1, mean of 5 trials",
  "unit": "%MVC"
 },
 "source": {
  "short": "Lariviere 2009",
  "authors": "Lariviere C, Gagnon D, Genest K",
